# GMS's barrier weakens what walks into it and pays boss damage as its passive
# half; here both halves are permanent. The attack penalty is GMS's own x%
# over 30 levels, read off this book's 20 -- 11% at level 1 to 30% at the
# master level. The DEF penalty beside it goes: no swing here reads a
# monster's DEF as a number it could take from. Boss damage is 1% a level over
# 20, where GMS pays 5+ceil(x/2)% over 30.
name: "Frailty Curse"
description:
  "Summons a barrier around you. Decreases the Attack Power of enemies that "
  "step into the barrier. Also allows you to deal more damage to bosses."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_NIGHT_LORD skill_order: 5 }
max_level: 20
exceeds_master_level: true
base {
  boss_pct: 0.01
  enemy_attack_pct: 0.11
}
per_level {
  boss_pct: 0.01
  enemy_attack_pct: 0.01
}
